---
version: 2.0.0
title: compiler__assignment_with_multiple_values
---
a, b, c = 1, 2, 3

------------------------------

function main(...) --from line 1 to line 1
    LOADCONSTANT in: 1, constant: 1
    SETGLOBAL name: a, to: 1
    LOADCONSTANT in: 2, constant: 2
    SETGLOBAL name: b, to: 2
    LOADCONSTANT in: 3, constant: 3
    SETGLOBAL name: c, to: 3
end
